<title>USA: VIMRx goes from Nasdaq SmallCap to National.</title>
<headline>VIMRx goes from Nasdaq SmallCap to National.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>VIMRx Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it will move from the Nasdaq SmallCap Market to the Nasdaq National Market System, effective Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that moving to the National Market System will &quot;broaden investor access and increase trading flexibility&quot; for VIMRx shares.</p>
<p>VIMRx said that the move also shows a &quot;strong financial position&quot; the company has achieved as a result of recent warrant redemption and private placement activities.</p>
</text>
